    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Community</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serena Island</h2>Discover a world full of possibilities in Project Real, an immersive life simulator. Embark on a journey on Serena Island, where every step you take defines your character's destiny.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/baf948115f0004fde74825d7b86ac13c.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br><br><strong> Is it a farm game? </strong><br>Real Project sets itself apart from other life simulators by offering a wide variety of careers and opportunities for you to explore. Become a fishing expert, run your own restaurant, create stunning jewelry - the choice is yours. Your success depends entirely on your choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/1dce2760d212a7d6be63cacba3e0b36b.webp?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br>Take part in the exciting seasonal events and festivals that animate Serena Island throughout the year. Celebrate local traditions, join in lively competitions and immerse yourself in unique experiences.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/b80ea4330cd01b74c7fc1c9d10f90aa5.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/86585fab51e2d6f27b42838d796c54ed.webp?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/c01bd519e827cc49fefb50df79e31459.avif?t=1732665357\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>Project Real offers a diverse range of social interactions and relationships, allowing you to discover how each connection will shape your destiny. Every conversation, every action you take will influence the course of your life on the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find valuable resources while exploring</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/eca0d95f7e67133a48666ac2ba54bd81.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collecting</h2>Collecting and selling items such as fruit, objects and collected garbage are essential aspects of your progress on Serena Island. These resources play a key role in your initial growth<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Business!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/25d1c9a1a4ba4dbe70908d1de4ea9967.avif?t=1732665357\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>You will have the opportunity to acquire your own store and carry out customized renovations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/c7753cfa5677d3ea7aa54c08b54ffb9c.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br>Complete the main collections that will help you unravel the mystery of the stars on Serena Island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the map of Serena Island.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/5023577ab816d1e8c7bf1263cde94a8f.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Central Beach<br></li><li> Forest Corner<br></li><li> Forest of Mists<br></li><li> Recanto Condominium<br></li><li> Waterways<br></li><li> Serene Forest<br></li><li> Moon Beach</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/93dcf3e73ae8923f920e105d6d7c903f.avif?t=1732665357\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your character or your house </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/2c7c3b7fc93fa550686679bd49d0a2a3.poster.avif?t=1732665357\" width=615 height=171 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/2c7c3b7fc93fa550686679bd49d0a2a3.webm?t=1732665357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>On Serena Island, if you want to buy or sell something, you'll need to look for a vendor or a specific store.<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Community</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serena Island</h2>Discover a world full of possibilities in Project Real, an immersive life simulator. Embark on a journey on Serena Island, where every step you take defines your character's destiny.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/baf948115f0004fde74825d7b86ac13c.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br><br><strong> Is it a farm game? </strong><br>Real Project sets itself apart from other life simulators by offering a wide variety of careers and opportunities for you to explore. Become a fishing expert, run your own restaurant, create stunning jewelry - the choice is yours. Your success depends entirely on your choices.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/1dce2760d212a7d6be63cacba3e0b36b.webp?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br>Take part in the exciting seasonal events and festivals that animate Serena Island throughout the year. Celebrate local traditions, join in lively competitions and immerse yourself in unique experiences.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/b80ea4330cd01b74c7fc1c9d10f90aa5.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/86585fab51e2d6f27b42838d796c54ed.webp?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/c01bd519e827cc49fefb50df79e31459.avif?t=1732665357\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>Project Real offers a diverse range of social interactions and relationships, allowing you to discover how each connection will shape your destiny. Every conversation, every action you take will influence the course of your life on the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find valuable resources while exploring</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/eca0d95f7e67133a48666ac2ba54bd81.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collecting</h2>Collecting and selling items such as fruit, objects and collected garbage are essential aspects of your progress on Serena Island. These resources play a key role in your initial growth<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Business!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/25d1c9a1a4ba4dbe70908d1de4ea9967.avif?t=1732665357\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br>You will have the opportunity to acquire your own store and carry out customized renovations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/c7753cfa5677d3ea7aa54c08b54ffb9c.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br>Complete the main collections that will help you unravel the mystery of the stars on Serena Island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the map of Serena Island.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/5023577ab816d1e8c7bf1263cde94a8f.avif?t=1732665357\" width=616 height=171 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Central Beach<br></li><li> Forest Corner<br></li><li> Forest of Mists<br></li><li> Recanto Condominium<br></li><li> Waterways<br></li><li> Serene Forest<br></li><li> Moon Beach</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/93dcf3e73ae8923f920e105d6d7c903f.avif?t=1732665357\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your character or your house </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/2c7c3b7fc93fa550686679bd49d0a2a3.poster.avif?t=1732665357\" width=615 height=171 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627600/extras/2c7c3b7fc93fa550686679bd49d0a2a3.webm?t=1732665357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>On Serena Island, if you want to buy or sell something, you'll need to look for a vendor or a specific store.<br><br>",
    "short_description": "The Real Project is a game where you shape your virtual life. Choose professions, build authentic relationships and explore a wide, vibrant world full of fascinating NPCs. Face challenges, explore stunning landscapes. Live a complete virtual life, full of unique adventures.",
